hifiberry-pipewire-configs (1.0.0) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of HiFiBerry PipeWire configuration package
  * Extracted from hifiberry-pipewire package for modular installation
  * Includes headless system configuration (99-hifiberry-headless.conf)
  * Includes stereo balance filter for WirePlumber with runtime control
  * Includes ALSA configuration optimized for HiFiBerry devices
  * Includes system service configuration for WirePlumber
  * Package depends on hifiberry-pipewire base package

